{"type":"message","id":"d81ec88c","parentId":"93b21bcd","timestamp":"2026-03-04T09:02:33.391Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-88e190106f1d4212b6fa637d841db6a5","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#pragma once\n\n#include <cgnslib.h>\n\n#include <string>\n#include <limits>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n#include <set>\n\nusing std::set;\nusing std::map;\nusing std::string;\nusing std::vector;\nusing std::unordered_map;\n\nnamespace MeshCut\n{\nvoid check(const int runCode, string&& errStr=\"\", string&& okStr=\"\");\n\nvoid check(bool state, string&& errStr=\"\", string&& okStr=\"\");\n\nclass CGFile\n{\npublic:\n    static const unordered_map<ElementType_t, vector<vector<int>>> nodeIdToBuildFaceInCell;\n    struct Section;\n\nprivate:\n    struct Face;\n    struct CellLoader;\n\npublic:\n    CGFile(string filename, int mode = CG_MODE_READ);\n\npublic:\n    static vector<vector<cgsize_t>> allFaceInCell(const vector<cgsize_t>& idList, ElementType_t type);\n\n    Section& addSection();\n\n    Section bodySection();\n\n    const vector<int>& bodySectionIdList() const;\n\n    const vector<int>& bdySectionIdList() const;\n\n    static ElementType_t CellType(const int nodeCnt, const int dim);\n\n    static ElementType_t CellType(const int CGNSCellTypeFalg);\n\n    void close();\n\n    vector<vector<double>> loadCoordinate(const cgsize_t rangeMin, const cgsize_t rangeMax);\n    \n    Section& loadSection(const int id);\n\n    Section& loadSection(const int id, const cgsize_t start, const cgsize_t end);\n        \n    Section loadSection(const vector<int> idList);\n\n    Section loadSection(const vector<int> idList, const cgsize_t start, const cgsize_t end);\n\n    cgsize_t nCell() const;\n\n    void nCell(const cgsize_t ncell);\n\n    cgsize_t nNode() const;\n\n    void nNode(const cgsize_t nnode);\n\n    Section& section(const int id);\n\n    static string stringAFace(const vector<cgsize_t>& face);\n\n    void writeCoordinate(const vector<vector<double>>& data);\n\n    void writeSection(Section &curS, const map<cgsize_t, cgsize_t>& nodeIdG2L);\n\n    void writeGlobalInfo(const Section &curS, const cgsize_t n, const cgsize_t start, const cgsize_t end);\n\npublic:\n    struct Section\n    {\n        int id = 1;\n        char name[33] = {0};\n        ElementType_t cellType;\n        cgsize_t start=1, end=1, dataSize=0;\n        int nBdy=0;\n        vector<vector<cgsize_t>> data;\n        vector<cgsize_t> offset{0}, typeFlag;\n        map<cgsize_t, cgsize_t> IDMap;\n\n        void addCell(const cgsize_t id, const vector<cgsize_t>& idList, const cgsize_t flag = CG_Null);\n        void clear();\n        const vector<cgsize_t>& cell(const int id) const;\n        cgsize_t flag(const int id) const;\n        bool isMixed() const;\n        void printToFile(string fname);\n        Section subSection(const cgsize_t beg, const cgsize_t end);\n    };\n\nprivate:\n    struct Face\n    {\n        Face(const vector<cgsize_t>& val);\n        Face(vector<cgsize_t>&& val) noexcept;\n        \n        Face(const Face& other);\n        Face(Face&& other) noexcept;\n\n        Face& operator=(const Face& other);\n        Face& operator=(Face&& other) noexcept;\n\n        vector<cgsize_t> nodeList; \n        bool operator==(const Face &other) const;\n        bool operator<(const Face& rhs) const;\n    };\n\n    struct CellLoader\n    {\n        /**\n         * @brief Construct a new Cell Loader object\n         * \n         * @param curS CGNS 文件结构 Section 引用\n         * @param fp 文件句柄\n         * @param lowerBound 当前 Section 的 ID 下界，包含该边界值 \n         * @param upperBound 当前 Section 的 ID 上界，包含该边界值\n         */\n        CellLoader(Section& curS, const int fp, const cgsize_t lowerBound = -1, const cgsize_t upperBound = std::numeric_limits<cgsize_t>::max());\n\n        /**\n         * @brief 将入参赋值为当前加载器构造时指定范围内的组成下一个Cell的 Node ID\n         * \n         * @param nodes Node 列表引用\n         * @return true 赋值成功\n         * @return false 已达到末尾，nodes 不可用\n         */\n        bool nextCell(vector<cgsize_t>& nodes);\n        \n        int flag = CG_Null;\n\n    private:\n        Section& curS;\n        vector<cgsize_t> data;\n        vector<cgsize_t> offset;\n        int fp, npe;\n        cgsize_t id = 0, blockSize = 0, start = 0, blockId = 0, len = 0, lowerBound = 0, upperBound = 0;\n        bool loadNextBlock();\n    };\n\nprivate:\n    string filename_;\n    int fp;\n    map<int, int> smallFiles_;\n    bool isOpen_ = false;\n\n    int cell_dim_, ibase=1, izone=1, igrid=1, ncoords;\n    cgsize_t zoneInfo[3] = {0, 0, 0};\n    DataType_t coordDataType_;\n    vector<string> coordname_;\n    \n    map<int, cgsize_t> globalNumber_;\n    map<int, cgsize_t> globalOffset_;\n    map<int, Section> sections_;\n    vector<int> bodySectionIDList_, bdySectionIDList_, interiorSection_;\n    cgsize_t idOffset_ = 1;\n\nprivate:\n\n    void checkFile();\n\n    bool isBodySection(const Section& section);\n\n    void loadCoordinateInfo();\n\n    void loadCGIOInfo();\n\n    int precision();\n};\n} // namespace MeshCut\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772614953389}}
{"type":"message","id":"42ee39fb","parentId":"d81ec88c","timestamp":"2026-03-04T09:02:56.256Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good understanding of the code structure. Let me plan the three modifications:\n\n1. **P0-1: Fix `distribute()` load balancing** - The function at line 20-26 needs to be changed from using ceiling division to proper remainder-based distribution.\n\n2. **P0-2: Optimize `collect_interface()` communication** - The function at lines 94-132 needs to be rewritten to use point-to-point communication instead of MPI_Alltoallv.\n\n3. **P1-3: Interface data structure optimization** - Change `outerFace_` from `unordered_map<int, map<string, vector<cgsize_t>>>` to `unordered_map<int, unordered_map<size_t, vector<cgsize_t>>>` with a hash function.\n\nThe challenge is that `outerFace_` is used extensively in multiple places:\n- `collect_interface()` - packs/unpacks using string\n- `rwBoundary()` - uses `stringAFace` to create strings and looks them up\n- `rwInterface()` - iterates and erases from outerFace\n- `updateOuterFace()` - creates strings and inserts into outerFace\n- `writeInterface()` - similar to rwInterface\n\nI need to:\n1. Add a hash function for faces\n2. Change the header declaration of `outerFace_`\n3. Update all functions that use `outerFace_` to use the hash-based approach\n\nLet me start with the modifications:\n\n### Step 1: Modify the header file\n- Add hash function\n- Change `outerFace_` type\n\n### Step 2: Modify the cpp file\n- Fix `distribute()`\n- Optimize `collect_interface()`\n- Update all functions using `outerFace_`\n\nLet me do this systematically.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I understand the code structure. I need to make three changes:\n1. Fix `distribute()` load balancing\n2. Optimize `collect_interface()` communication\n3. Change `outerFace_` data structure from string keys to hash keys\n\nLet me start with the modifications:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-7296dad8deb549f990c6a1c660c15213","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.h","oldText":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;","newText":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n#include <functional>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;\n\n// Hash function for face (vector of cgsize_t)\ninline size_t hashFace(const vector<cgsize_t>& face) {\n    size_t h = 0;\n    for (auto id : face)\n        h ^= hash<cgsize_t>{}(id) + 0x9e3779b9 + (h << 6) + (h >> 2);\n    return h;\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":1297,"output":1041,"cacheRead":20185,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22523,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772614953391}}
