{"type":"message","id":"04c593c2","parentId":"7f5c37af","timestamp":"2026-03-04T09:03:52.260Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to update the `collect_interface()` function. Let me first look at the current implementation more carefully and understand what needs to be changed.\n\nThe current implementation uses `MPI_Alltoallv` which broadcasts all data to all processes. I need to change it to:\n1. First determine which processes need to communicate (those that have data for each other)\n2. Use point-to-point communication with `MPI_Isend/MPI_Irecv`\n\nLet me implement the optimized version.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me update the `collect_interface()` function. This is a significant change, so I'll replace the whole function:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-1f6880a3c3ea483ba5848843e29a3141","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","newText":"// collect interface from all other threads\nvoid MetisCutter::collect_interface()\n{\n    // Pack interface data into a string for sending\n    auto packInterface = [&, this]() -> std::string\n    {\n        std::string sendStr;\n        for (auto ifile : outerFace_)\n        {\n            if (ifile.second.empty()) continue;\n\n            sendStr += (std::to_string(ifile.first) + \":\");\n            for (auto face : ifile.second) { sendStr += (std::to_string(face.first) + \";\"); }\n            sendStr += \"#\";\n        }\n\n        return sendStr;\n    };\n\n    // Unpack received interface data\n    auto unpackInterface = [&, this](const std::string &recvStr)\n    {\n        for (auto ifile : stringSplit(recvStr, \"#\"))\n        {\n            if (ifile.empty()) continue;\n            auto cur = stringSplit(ifile, \":\");\n            if (cur.size() < 2) continue;\n            auto nbrFile = std::stoi(cur[0]);\n            if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) continue;\n\n            check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %d interface of file %d\\n\", RANK, stringSplit(cur[1], \";\").size(), nbrFile));\n\n            auto &nbrOuterface = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n            for (auto faceHash : stringSplit(cur[1], \";\")) { \n                if (!faceHash.empty()) {\n                    nbrOuterface.insert({std::stoull(faceHash), {}});\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    };\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    std::string sendTmp = packInterface();\n    int sendCnt = sendTmp.size();\n\n    // Step 1: Determine which ranks have data to send (non-empty send buffer)\n    std::vector<int> sendCnts(SIZE, 0);\n    sendCnts[RANK] = sendCnt;\n    MPI_Allgather(&sendCnt, 1, MPI_INT, sendCnts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    // Step 2: Identify target ranks (those with non-empty data)\n    std::vector<int> targetRanks;\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            targetRanks.push_back(i);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Step 3: Use point-to-point communication only with target ranks\n    std::vector<MPI_Request> requests;\n    std::vector<int> recvCnt(SIZE, 0);\n    std::vector<std::string> recvBuffers(SIZE);\n    std::vector<char*> recvBuffersPtr(SIZE, nullptr);\n\n    // Post non-blocking receives from all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            recvCnt[i] = sendCnts[i];\n            recvBuffers[i].assign(recvCnt[i] + 1, '\\0');\n            recvBuffersPtr[i] = const_cast<char*>(recvBuffers[i].data());\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Irecv(recvBuffersPtr[i], recvCnt[i], MPI_CHAR, i, DataTAG + i, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Post non-blocking sends to all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[RANK] > 0) {\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Isend(const_cast<char*>(sendTmp.data()), sendCnt, MPI_CHAR, i, RANK + DataTAG, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Wait for all communications to complete\n    if (!requests.empty()) {\n        std::vector<MPI_Status> statuses(requests.size());\n        MPIAdapter::WaitAll(requests.size(), requests.data(), statuses.data());\n    }\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    // Process received data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0 && !recvBuffers[i].empty()) {\n            unpackInterface(recvBuffers[i]);\n        }\n    }\n}","oldText":"// collect interface from all other threads\nvoid MetisCutter::collect_interface()\n{\n    auto packInterface = [&, this]() -> std::string\n    {\n        std::string sendStr;\n        for (auto ifile : outerFace_)\n        {\n            if (ifile.second.empty()) continue;\n\n            sendStr += (std::to_string(ifile.first) + \":\");\n            for (auto face : ifile.second) { sendStr += (face.first + \";\"); }\n            sendStr += \"#\";\n        }\n\n        return sendStr;\n    };\n\n    auto unpackInterface = [&, this](const string &recvStr)\n    {\n        for (auto ifile : stringSplit(recvStr, \"#\"))\n        {\n            auto cur = stringSplit(ifile, \":\");\n            auto nbrFile = std::stoi(cur[0]);\n            if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) continue;\n\n            check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %d interface of file %d\\n\", RANK, stringSplit(cur[1], \";\").size(), nbrFile));\n\n            auto &nbrOuterface = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n            for (auto face : stringSplit(cur[1], \";\")) { nbrOuterface.insert({face, {}}); }\n        }\n    };\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    string sendTmp = packInterface(), recvStr, sendStr;\n    int sendCnt = sendTmp.size();\n    vector<int> sendCnts(SIZE, sendCnt), sdisp(SIZE, 0), rdisp(SIZE, 0), recvCnt(SIZE, 0);\n\n    MPI_Alltoall(sendCnts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, recvCnt.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (auto i = 1; i < SIZE; ++i) rdisp[i] = rdisp[i - 1] + recvCnt[i - 1];\n    recvStr.assign(std::accumulate(recvCnt.begin(), recvCnt.end(), 0) + 1, ' ');\n    for (auto i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) sendStr += sendTmp;\n    for (auto i = 1; i < SIZE; ++i) sdisp[i] = sdisp[i - 1] + sendCnt;\n    MPI_Alltoallv(sendStr.data(), sendCnts.data(), sdisp.data(), MPI_CHAR, (char *)(recvStr.data()), recvCnt.data(), rdisp.data(), MPI_CHAR, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n    unpackInterface(stringTrim(recvStr));\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":425,"output":1718,"cacheRead":21912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24055,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772614993748}}
