{"type":"message","id":"aafa37cb","parentId":"5d12ca7b","timestamp":"2026-03-04T09:05:14.782Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The rwInterface function is already using hash keys (face->first), so no change is needed there. Let me check the writeInterface function which also uses outerFace_:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me update the `writeInterface` function:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-36eeeede5cc440758c36b568fcb90070","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","newText":"void MetisCutter::writeInterface(const int id, const int np)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[id];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[id];\n\n    for (auto nbr = 0; nbr < np; ++nbr)\n    {\n        if (nbr == id) continue;\n        auto nbrIsOwner = ownerFile_.count(nbr) != 0;\n\n        auto &nbrOuterFace = outerFace_[nbr];\n\n        set<cgsize_t> typeFlags;\n        CGFile::Section curS, nbrS;\n        for (auto face = nbrOuterFace.begin(); face != nbrOuterFace.end();)\n        {\n            auto it = curOuterFace.find(face->first);\n            if (it != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curS.data.emplace_back(it->second);\n                auto t = CGFile::CellType(it->second.size(), 2);\n                curS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                typeFlags.insert(it->second.size());\n                it = curOuterFace.erase(it);\n\n                if (nbrIsOwner)\n                {\n                    nbrS.data.push_back(face->second);\n                    nbrS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                    face = nbrOuterFace.erase(face);\n                }\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                ++face;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!curS.data.empty())\n        {\n            strcpy(curS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", nbr).c_str());\n            if (nbrIsOwner) strcpy(nbrS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\"